# Task 1 – Entity Relationship Diagram

## Project

Smart Lender – Loan Eligibility Prediction System

## Objective

Design an Entity Relationship Diagram (ERD) representing the database structure of the Smart Lender application.

## Entities

- User
- Applicant Profile
- Credit History
- Loan Application
- Model
- Prediction Result

## Relationships

- User → Applicant Profile (1:N)
- Applicant Profile → Credit History (1:1)
- Applicant Profile → Loan Application (1:N)
- Loan Application → Prediction Result (1:1)
- Model → Prediction Result (1:N)

## Files

```
Task-01-Entity-Relationship-Diagram/
│
├── README.md
├── Documentation.md
└── images/
    └── ER_Diagram.png
```

## Output

The ER Diagram defines the database schema and relationships required for the Loan Eligibility Prediction System.

